{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-21a","no":"EP.21A","tag":"EP.21A · 想不起的名字","title":"想不起的名字","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-21a:1","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi悄悄走出熟睡的房间。关门前，他回头看了一眼。Yeoni踢开被子，张着嘴睡着。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:2","s":"neo","t":"盖好被子再睡。感冒了，又要怪客服吧。","x":"soft","l":null,"c":{"who":"neo","x":"soft"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-21a:3","s":"n","t":"他用前爪夹住被角，拉到Yeoni肩头。Yeoni翻了个身，把那只前爪当枕头，抱进怀里。"},{"id":"ep-21a:4","s":"neo","t":"放手。我不是枕头。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:5","s":"n","t":"Yeoni没松开。Yeongnyangi就这样趴了许久，才极慢地抽出前爪，塞了一本书进去代替。"},{"id":"ep-21a:6","s":"neo","t":"抱歉。今天这本书代班客服。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:7","s":"n","t":"没有回答。Yeoni只在梦里，含糊地说了一句，一星。Yeongnyangi轻轻笑了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:8","s":"n","t":"上楼时，他把肩膀靠在墙上。左爪又不听使唤了。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-21a:9","s":"n","t":"他抬起前爪。红锈沿着焦痕蔓延。落水之后，锈每天长出一指节。","im":true,"shot":"close","fx":"metal","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:10","s":"neo","t":"遇火烧焦，遇水生锈。金属也真难照顾。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:11","s":"n","t":"他用斗篷下摆盖住锈迹。明早也不能让Yeoni看见。虽然摩卡和闰月已经发现，不过那两人嘴很严。"},{"id":"ep-21a:12","s":"n","t":"不对，水獭不严。今天下午，那条尾巴，大概什么都说了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:13","s":"n","t":"雨的气味从楼梯窗飘进来。猫停住，闻了许久。","bgm":"memWater","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:14","s":"n","t":"雨中的车站。雨水从旧屋檐下，连成线落下。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:15","s":"n","t":"一只小手撑着伞，伞半倾着，偏向身边的人。"},{"id":"ep-21a:16","s":"n","t":"伞下，有人笑着。淋着雨，傻乎乎的，却无比开心。","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:17","s":"n","t":"「一起撑吧」的声音混在雨声里。直到那声音远去，猫一直闭着眼。"},{"id":"ep-21a:18","s":"n","t":"他把额头抵上冷墙。雨细了，楼梯重新安静。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:19","s":"neo","t":"下雨的日子，脚更沉。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:20","s":"sys","t":"［ 客服通知 · 守护者状态检查 · 左前爪锈蚀 · 进行中 ］","im":true,"fx":"script","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:21","s":"n","t":"金字在眼前浮起，又消失。客服倒总准时通知这些。"},{"id":"ep-21a:22","s":"neo","t":"知道。不劳特意通知。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:23","s":"n","t":"他抖抖前爪，继续上楼。通往屋顶的门被风吹得作响。"},{"id":"ep-21a:24","s":"neo","t":"再撑一会。那孩子的评分还只有一星。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:25","s":"n","t":"他看着楼梯窗映出的自己。深蓝帽子，泛着金光的紫眼睛，生锈的前爪。那是戴帽子的猫的脸。"},{"id":"ep-21a:26","s":"neo","t":"那孩子看这张脸，只问是不是普通的猫。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:27","s":"n","t":"随后打分，一星。那天的一颗星，猫仍记得清清楚楚。"},{"id":"ep-21a:28","s":"n","t":"屋顶上，风很大。被吞去一半的太阳，挂在夜空。那是既非白昼，也非黑夜的天空。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"stillLake","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:29","s":"n","t":"屋顶尽头，坐着黑虎。仿佛从一开始，就在等他。"},{"id":"ep-21a:30","s":"tiger","t":"上楼的声音，我全听见了，猫先生。","x":"base","l":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-21a:31","s":"neo","t":"闻到雨味，过来看看。又来偷谁的书。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:32","s":"tiger","t":"今天不是来工作，是有话对您说。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:33","s":"neo","t":"对猪说话不客气，对我也不客气。你会对谁恭恭敬敬呢。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:34","s":"tiger","t":"请别问无谓的问题。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:35","s":"neo","t":"对账簿的主人吗。对那个声音。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:36","s":"tiger","t":"请闭嘴。那个声音，现在也一直听着呢。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:37","s":"n","t":"老虎瞥了一眼天空。半轮太阳的黑色一侧，极缓慢地蠕动着。"},{"id":"ep-21a:38","s":"n","t":"老虎的红眼，落到Yeongnyangi的左爪上。准确地找到了，斗篷下摆盖住的锈迹。"},{"id":"ep-21a:39","s":"tiger","t":"那只脚，每天都会蔓延一节吧。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:40","s":"neo","t":"你怎么知道。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:41","s":"tiger","t":"账上全有。您每在那孩子身边受伤一次，她那栏就会沉一分。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:42","s":"neo","t":"别动她那一栏。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:43","s":"tiger","t":"动她的是您。她的火越大，您融得越多；您越撑着，她就越小。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:44","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi没回答。两人都知道，他无话反驳。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:45","s":"tiger","t":"请离开。现在离开，她还能靠七格活下去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:46","s":"neo","t":"七格，会变成容器。你也知道吧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:47","s":"tiger","t":"您怎么知道。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:48","s":"neo","t":"就算看不了账簿，我也会看天。被吞掉的太阳想要什么，我还是看得出来。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:49","s":"n","t":"雨滴开始落在两人之间。明明天很晴，只有他们站着的地方下起了雨。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-21a:50","s":"tiger","t":"您一闻到雨味，脸色就变得奇怪呢。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:51","s":"neo","t":"错觉。猫本来就讨厌湿。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:52","s":"tiger","t":"是吗？那我也当自己看错了。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:53","s":"n","t":"老虎的尾巴重重拍在地上。雨水飞溅。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:54","s":"tiger","t":"请别这样看。我讨厌同情，比讨厌债还甚。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:55","s":"neo","t":"不是同情。看你的账本湿了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:56","s":"tiger","t":"账本总是湿的，我走到哪里，雨便跟到哪里。","x":"sad","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 tiger의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-21a:57","s":"n","t":"老虎没再说，抬爪攥紧颈上的环，尽管那环此刻什么也没做。"},{"id":"ep-21a:58","s":"tiger","t":"请别装作明白，您连账都看不见。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:59","s":"neo","t":"看不见，所以问。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:60","s":"tiger","t":"我全记得，一点也没漏，才过着这样的日子。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:61","s":"neo","t":"所以在那声音手下做事吗。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:62","s":"tiger","t":"会长会准确收回债，我要的只有这个。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:63","s":"n","t":"猫的前爪一缩，锈处骤然灼热。每次提起会长，锈便刺痛。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:64","s":"neo","t":"那会长不光收债，也收容器。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:65","s":"tiger","t":"知道。可我还是要收回应收的。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:66","s":"tiger","t":"请别再问，我没有向猫先生说自己处境的理由。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:67","s":"neo","t":"彼此彼此。我也不知道你的名字。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:68","s":"n","t":"风吹过。Yeongnyangi眼眸深处，金光骤起，又消失。那道光，连他自己也没察觉。","im":true,"fx":"veil","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:69","s":"tiger","t":"您现在那个眼神。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:70","s":"neo","t":"别在意。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:71","s":"tiger","t":"空格前也是这种眼神。您是不知道，还是装不知道呢。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:72","s":"neo","t":"客服不回答私人问题。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:73","s":"n","t":"这时，下方传来开窗声。极其小心，却又像猪会做的那样，还是有点吵。"},{"id":"ep-21a:74","s":"n","t":"白猫与黑虎同时转头。窗框上，挂着一只粉红色前蹄。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
